ll made custom so far. You only get phase 2 and/or phase 3's tools if you have enough lv for them, so you can use toxin's earlier phases without having to grind for the characters necessary to make phase 3. This character is still unfinished however as I didnt add the clientsided phase transition textbox yet nor did I give him any music. This level of quality will be the standard for most customs going forward)\n- Reworked Shattered Dream\n- More to come\n\nFree Characters\n-------------------\n- Special Characters Gamepass (click again after respawning if you don't have the gamepass)\n- Trio Characters Gamepass (click again after respawning if you don't have the gamepass)\n- Soultale Sans\n- Nighterror Sans\n- Anti Corruption Sans\n- Spongeswap SpongeBob (Sometimes fails if you don't have enough resets due to the reset anticheat sometimes working, but it will work after a few attempts. Will always work if you have 3 resets tho)\n\nMap TPs\n-----------\n- Snowdin\n- Waterfall\n- Hotland\n- Last Corridor\n- Doodle Sphere\n- Fatal Void\n- Gaster Room\n- Lobby\n\nBasic Shit\n------------\n- Spam Tool (Idea by <@.tomfooler on discord>, recreated by me)\n- Click TP Tool\n- Infinite Yield\n- Remove Anticheat\n- Disable Blindnesses (toggleable)\n- 999,999 HP (460,000 LV required)\n- Autosprint (toggleable)\n- Grab All Tools\n- Remove Nametag\n- Invisibility\n- Fix Health Bars (Makes other player's overhead health bars actually work properly. Doesn't lag and is toggleable)\n\nPress P to hide/show the menu (currently E)","tags":["smb","sans","undertale","overwrite","smbl"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"64d4abc246933fe26043a364","username":"greenstevereal2401","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"64d4abc246933fe26043a364","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":fa